<title>FINLAND: MERITA DETAILS H1 SECURITIES TRADING.</title>
<headline>MERITA DETAILS H1 SECURITIES TRADING.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's largest banking group Merita Oy said on Wednesday its H1 income from securities trading totalled 1.35 billion markka net of hedging, some 750 million of which was on disposals.</p>
<p>The total compared to 552 million in the year-ago period. A Merita spokeswoman said the remaining 600 million had come from ordinary trading.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
